- #vikzhel_offers
- #vizkhel_cancel
- @accept_offer
- @reject_offer


@accept_offer
title: Agree to the offer. 
unavailable-subtitle: The other parties will not accept the current offer. 
choose-if: influence > 25
go-to: reaction

@reject_offer
title: It seems we can't come to an agreement. 
go-to: reaction




